In luau there are multiple kinds of files.
Scripts, moduleScripts and localScripts.

Scripts and localScripts are executed at start.
moduleScripts require one of the others to call them.
To do that the require function is called.
This function will return what is returned in the called file.

Scripts run on server side and local side.
Local Scripts are used for user-specific services.
The Server Scripts handle everything else.

